2:15	compose:state-param-check	manual	State shouldn't be used as a parameter in a @Composable function, as it encourages components that are not fully stateless.\nInstead, pass the snapshot state value and provide event callbacks for changes.\nSee https://github.com/androidx/androidx/blob/androidx-main/compose/docs/compose-component-api-guidelines.md#statet-as-a-parameter for more information.
